    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115253" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψάγιος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>oblique, askew,</i> metaph., <i>mal à
				propos, blundering,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ πὰρ μέλος ἔρχομαι ψάγιον</span>
			(sic codd. vett.) 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄαρον ἐννέπων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					7.69
				</span></i>
			: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψάγιον:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλάγιον, λοξόν, ἐπικεκλιμένον,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψάδιον:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάταντες,</span> Id.</div>
